WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.970 line:85%
Every forecast is a promise.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.154 line:85%
In Da Nang, it breaks.

00:00:06.854 --> 00:00:11.308 line:85%
Last autumn, storms cancelled or postponed up to forty percent of tours.

00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:14.143 line:85%
Apps tell you the wind. Never what to do.

00:00:15.193 --> 00:00:18.377 line:85%
So we built something that doesn't just predict the weather.

00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:19.996 line:85%
It decides.

00:00:21.946 --> 00:00:23.944 line:85%
Ask the way you'd ask a colleague.

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:27.569 line:85%
Seven forecasts become one.

00:00:29.019 --> 00:00:32.221 line:85%
Every answer is checked against real safety rules.

00:00:33.671 --> 00:00:36.490 line:85%
When the storm moves in, your plan moves with it.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.374 line:85%
For the traveler. The builder. The farmer.

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:44.502 line:85%
Ninety-one percent of calls match the experts.

00:00:44.652 --> 00:00:46.780 line:85%
A decision in under five seconds.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.711 line:85%
Zero unsafe calls.

00:00:49.161 --> 00:00:52.362 line:85%
Top ten at the Vietnam AI Open Hackathon.

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:54.755 line:85%
Weatherise.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.865 line:85%
The best weather is the weather you planned for.
